.TH paynal-clean 1  "clean " 
.SH NAME
paynal\-clean \- Clean unindexed orphan files or output directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpaynal clean\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clean unindexed orphan files or output directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Target to clean: "project" (unindexed files) or "out" (output dir)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
project
.IP \(bu 2
out
.RE
